// Drop assassination from 250 uu above an unaware guard (attack pressed while falling, directly above).
// Original (melee.md, 0x00C09900): the player falls (Velocity.z < 0), the target NPC is below within
// m_fMaxDropDistToTarget 350 (otherwise the type is TooHighToStart), and a pawn-extent trace (flags 0x20DF)
// from the pawn reaches the target; context reach 250. No minimum fall speed. The port requires a
// fall speed of 300 uu/s at the press tick (SPECULATIVE) and checks only once, at the press.
(
    name: "combat/melee_drop_assassinate_h250",
    system: Combat,
    map: "Playground",
    description: "Teleport 250 uu above a passive guard and press attack right after the fall starts.",
    setup: (
        player: Some((position: (-5440, 0, 96), yaw: 180)),
        npcs: [(id: Some("dummy"), position: Some((-5440, 0, 92)), yaw: 180, state: Some("Passive"))],
        settle: 30,
    ),
    ticks: 120,
    input: [
        (tick: 1, action: Console("teleport -5440 0 346 180")),
        (tick: 3, action: Press(Primary)),
    ],
    checkpoints: [
        (name: "drop assassination", expect: [(metric: Count("Sim:Death@dummy[cause=DropAssassination]"), value: 1, tol: 0, source: "TooHighToStart above 350 uu; DoNow within (melee.md); port needs 300 uu/s at the press", status: Unmeasured)]),
    ],
    record: [Pawn, Npc("dummy"), SimEvents],
    capture: Some("place the player 250 uu above an unaware guard, press attack one tick after the fall begins; record the context (DisItemContext_DropAssassinate) and m_CachedDropType"),
)